OL,3,GNEWSAQuarter of women still missing
OL,4,Abreast cancer screening
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver a quarter of eligible women in the
OL,7,FNorth West are missing breast cancer
OL,8,Fscreening appointments.
OL,10,FThe NHS said while uptake had improved
OL,11,Fslightly in the last year, 28.9% of
OL,12,Fwomen were still missing the
OL,13,Fpotentially life-saving tests.
OL,15,FBreast screening can detect cancer
OL,16,Fbefore people may notice any signs and
OL,17,Fsymptoms, and women are invited for the
OL,18,Ffirst time between the ages of 50 and
OL,19,F53, then every three years after that
OL,20,Funtil they are 71.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
