OL,3,GNEWSAQuarter of women still missing
OL,4,Abreast cancer screening
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Paula Cowan, a GP and the regional
OL,7,Fmedical director for primary care at
OL,8,FNHS England in the North West, said
OL,9,F"some people may be reluctant to come
OL,10,Fforward for a number of different
OL,11,Freasons" but that "breast screening...
OL,12,Fdetect cancer at an early stage".
